### RépareCampus — collection de tests HTTP
### Compatible avec l'extension VS Code « REST Client » et importable dans Postman.
### Exécuter les requêtes dans l'ordre : la connexion alimente les variables de jeton.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Santé du serveur
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### --- CONNEXIONS (mot de passe de démo : password123) ---

# @name loginRequester
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alex@repare.test", "password": "password123" }

###
@requesterToken = {{loginRequester.response.body.token}}

# @name loginRepairer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "noah@repare.test", "password": "password123" }

###
@repairerToken = {{loginRepairer.response.body.token}}
@repairerId = {{loginRepairer.response.body.user.id}}

# @name loginCoordinator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mila@repare.test", "password": "password123" }

###
@coordinatorToken = {{loginCoordinator.response.body.token}}

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@repare.test", "password": "password123" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Profil courant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}

### --- CATÉGORIES ---

# @name categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}

###
@categoryId = {{categories.response.body.0.id}}

### --- DEMANDES ---

### Liste de mes demandes (portée par rôle)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}

### Recherche et filtres (coordination voit tout)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests?status=waiting&q=écran&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}

### Créer une demande
# @name created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "device": { "type": "montre connectée", "brand": "NoNameUdS", "model": "W1" },
  "problemDescription": "Ne se connecte plus au Wifi.",
  "priority": "normal",
  "contact": { "method": "email", "value": "alex@repare.test" }
}

###
@requestId = {{created.response.body.id}}

### Détail + historique
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}

### Affecter à un réparateur (coordination)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "repairerId": "{{repairerId}}" }

### Diagnostic (réparateur assigné) -> in_diagnosis
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/diagnosis
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Module Wifi défectueux, remplacement nécessaire." }

### Estimation (réparateur) -> waiting
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/estimate
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 75, "currency": "CAD", "details": "Module Wifi + main-d'œuvre." }

### Réponse du demandeur -> in_repair (accepted) ou closed (refused)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/estimate/response
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "accepted" }

### Pièce (réparateur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Module Wifi", "quantity": 1, "unitCost": 30, "status": "ordered" }

### Intervention (réparateur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/interventions
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Remplacement du module Wifi.", "minutesSpent": 25 }

### Passage à l'état prêt à récupérer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ready_for_pickup" }

### Transition INVALIDE (attendu : 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repair-requests/{{requestId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{repairerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "in_diagnosis" }

### --- NOTIFICATIONS ---

### Mes notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}

### Tout marquer comme lu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}

### --- CRÉNEAUX (coordination) ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "start": "2026-11-10T14:00:00Z", "end": "2026-11-10T16:00:00Z", "capacity": 2 }

### --- STATISTIQUES (coordination) ---
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}

### --- TRAITEMENT NOCTURNE (démo) ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/nightly-batch
Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}

### --- TEMPS RÉEL (SSE) ---
### À ouvrir dans un terminal : curl -N "http://localhost:3000/api/events?token=<JWT>"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?token={{requesterToken}}
